      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, but it's a bit too brief for a full study guide section. Could you expand on the actual phases? Like prophase, metaphase, anaphase, and telophase? \n\nTry to go into more detail for each one so they really get it. And again, just a reminder to keep it natural—I don't want a bunch of repetitive filler, I just want a high-quality, detailed explanation that hits those pedagogical markers.",
